phrase: smooth window in_place rolling sum {w}
slot: w int
test: list=2,4,6,8,10 w=3
expect: => i=3 r=0.0 ok=true s="sum window in_place: 3" errors=0 n=3 res=[12,18,24] cache=0 hits=0
